update progressnote set 
description = 
'<p style="direction: rtl;">This worker went to the home of Robin Busch who is Ashley''s mother. She reported Susan, Ashley and Chloe are homeless and were hotel hoping. There was a man on Wempe Drive that has allowed them to stay with him in the past. She reported she has seen Chloe and she is back to eating junk food. She reported she thought something was up because they did not send Chloe to school. She figured they were hiding from CPS. This worker asked her if Chloe has been healthy, seen a doctor or been in the hospital. She reported Chloe has not been sick. She reported Ashley''s other daughter that lives with Robin was hospitalized at UPMC WM and they wanted to transfer her to a psych facility for suicide but there were no beds. Eventually they said she was not a risk, so they sent her home. Robin stated she is not sure where they are living now. They stayed in a hotel when they had some money. She said Ashley told her they are getting ready to sign a lease, but she does not know where. Robin has the same phone numbers for Ashley and Susan as this worker and they will not answer the phone, texts or return calls to this worker. I spoke with Robin about sending the final letter to her residence and she stated she would give it to Ashely when she comes by the house.</p>',
updatedon = now(),
updatedby = 'CDM-17713'
where progressnoteid = '261ceeb3-c4a0-4f19-8b6e-12115c46d8be';

